#. metadata.json->name
msgid "ShutdownMenu-change"
msgstr "关机菜单（修改版）"

#. metadata.json->description
msgid "A Cinnamon panel applet providing shutdown menu with additional workspace switching and window/workspace selector via mouse interactions.Modify ShutdownMenuWithIcons@LLOBERA to make it easier to use."
msgstr "一个 Cinnamon 面板小程序，提供关机菜单，并支持鼠标滚轮切换工作区、中键呼出工作区/窗口选择器。修改自 ShutdownMenuWithIcons@LLOBERA，使其更易于使用。"

